# Resilience Hub Toolkit: deployment configuration
#
# The site runs with no environment variables. Reading, notes, checklists,
# backup and restore all work on the device with nothing configured.
#
# Optional Cloudflare Pages bindings (set in the Pages project, not in .env):
#
# ARRIVALS_DB   D1 database for anonymous arrival counts. Schema:
#               migrations/0002_arrivals.sql and 0003_arrivals_cached_label.sql.
#               Without it, functions/_middleware.ts records nothing.
# ARRIVALS_KEY  Secret that opens GET /api/arrivals. Without it (or without
#               ARRIVALS_DB) that route answers 404.
#
# Workshop copy only (a separate, noindexed Pages project):
#
# WORKSHOP=1    Build variable. Adds the noindex header and meta tag.
# ROUND_ID      Build variable. The review round id; builds /rounds/<id>/.
# ROUND_PAGE    Build variable. The chapter under review, e.g.
#               emergency-preparedness/1-2.
# DB            D1 database for review-round notes.
#               Schema: migrations/0001_rounds_and_notes.sql.
